     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<div><br></div><div>I am currently working on a regression model including a random slope with a spatiotemporal interaction term. Since I wanted to compare results from four different types of spatiotemporal interaction, I tried</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">form</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m42c </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"color:#000\">y </span></font><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  f</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">GEOID</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;bym&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> graph </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> graph</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> constr </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> hyper </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> hyp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">prior</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  f</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">year1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;ar1&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> constr </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x2 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x3 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x4 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x5 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x6 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x7 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x8<br><br>form</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t42III </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> update</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">form</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m42c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">year3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;iid&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> GEOID2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                                         control</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">graph </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> graph</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;besag&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                                      constr </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>finla </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> inla</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">formula </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> form</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t42III</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>              control</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">compute </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">waic </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dic </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cpo </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                                       openmp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">strategy </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;large&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>              verbose </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>              control</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">inla </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> control</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">inla</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cmin </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.77</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">strategy </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;keep&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> strategy </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;simplified.laplace&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                                            </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">strategy </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;eb&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> restart </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> optimiser </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;gsl&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                                            stupid</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">search</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">factor </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.25</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#diagonal = 1e4</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>              control</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">prec</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">intercept </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0001</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>              control</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">predictor </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">compute </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>              control</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mode </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">restart </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>However, the model consumed all of my memory then crashed. I think my machine has a decent amount of RAM (64GB, FYI), and there was no problem with fitting models with type-I, II, and IV spatiotemporal interaction term.</div><div><br></div><div>Could you explain why the model with the type-III spatiotemporal interaction term is only crashed?</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you very much.</div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
